  "overview": "High school student Shingo Kashiwara is spending his summer vacation in a seaside town, and it turns out three girls from his school are staying at the same inn.\n\nThis adventure mahjong game mixes four-player mahjong with a light romance story set by the sea. Play through Story Mode, take on the girls at the mahjong table and get to know them over the summer.\n\n- 1 player"
